@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title 05. Promotion Creation & Merchant Mapping (Business Flow)

|Accountant|
start
:Design Campaign Strategy;
note right
  Defines the value (%),
  duration, and eligibility
  criteria.
end note

:Assign Promotion Scope;
note right
  Selects which shops,
  services, or categories
  will fund/offer the discount.
end note

|Internal Wallet System|
if (Campaign Conflicts Detected?) then (No)
  :Activate Promotion Rules;
  :Establish Merchant-Discount Linkage;
  note right
    Ensures the discount triggers
    automatically at the point
    of sale for linked shops.
  end note
else (Yes)
  |Accountant|
  :Resolve Configuration Conflicts;
  stop
endif

|Accountant|
:Monitor Campaign Performance;
stop
@enduml